Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.78,Flashback,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, Eiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.37,Flashback,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Eiji...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.43,Flashback,Eiji,0000,0000,0000,,I only have eyes for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.40,Flashback,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Eiji...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.32,Flashback,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get wet, Eiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:35.36,Flashback,Eiji,0000,0000,0000,,If I just think of it as your tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.83,Flashback,Eiji,0000,0000,0000,,getting soaked by the rain isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:45.63,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So this is where her heart flutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:47.42,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,All right, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:51.27,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan, let me borrow some manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:55.40,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,You're still studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:01:00.54,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The execution of revenge is just like studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:35.21,Episode Title,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(442,1)}#4 "Clear and Present Danger"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:36.28,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Don't ever collect such
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.56,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}erroneous information again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:40.80,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.77,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki Aki...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:48.65,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to make my revenge a \Nreality with this next plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:49.73,barasute,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H6B489E&}Rose-eyed Steroid\N{\c&H6A3830&}Hanano Rabuko
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:53.73,Main,TeacherA,0000,0000,0000,,All right, that's it for today's classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:57.74,Supplementary,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Supplementary Class
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:57.38,Main,TeacherA,0000,0000,0000,,All of you who have supplementary \Nclasses, please head over there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:08.75,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You have to sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.10,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.67,Emperor,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Emperor Go-Daigo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.67,Southern Imperial,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Southern Imperial Court (Yoshino)\NThree Imperial Regalia of Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.67,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,In this era when the conflict \Nbetween the Northern Imperial Court
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:16.11,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,and the Southern Imperial \NCourt was intense,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:19.54,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,the Southern Court, at one \Npoint, occupied Kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:23.32,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,But the Northern Imperial \NCourt was able to retake Kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:27.64,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Eventually, when Ashikaga \NYoshimitsu was enthroned,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:31.35,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,the Northern Imperial Court \Ncontinued to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:35.70,Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}They moved their residence \Nto Kitakoji Muromachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.00,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you face forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:44.01,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I only have eyes for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.97,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,So cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.59,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll have Yoshino \Nbring me an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.97,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If I just think of it as your tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:05.35,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,getting soaked by the rain isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:09.38,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:11.22,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:18.88,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How do you like my love-blooming plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:21.02,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I totally nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:26.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.66,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,"Seriously creepy," to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:32.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait a sec! Is that what Adagaki said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.93,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I think she said that 24 times today alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:36.94,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to kill that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.42,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I think so too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:41.35,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Listen here. "Rose-eyed Steroid" is a classic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.80,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bible for all maidens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.05,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:49.33,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Pig's Foot, it's time you withdrew a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:50.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.96,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just keep pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.28,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Mixing things up is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:57.68,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,"Mixing things up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:01.75,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, you can be as \Ncold as possible to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:10.45,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:14.66,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're late. How long does it take \Nyou to go to the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:18.30,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very sorry. There was a stray cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.99,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,As if I care about that. \NCome on, give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:34.98,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's true that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:40.69,Eh,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:40.69,Nothing,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,That has nothing to do \Nwith me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:40.69,Eiji cold,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,After Eiji started\Nacting cold to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:40.69,True feelings,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,I was finally able to realize \Nmy true feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:39.21,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,the heroine realizing how she really \Nfeels when the hero is cold to her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:40.69,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,is the most standard of tropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:45.01,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But what happens if I'm cold to \Nher and she hates me even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:48.66,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I feel as if I've finally rid myself \Nof one of those annoying flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:49.99,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's quite a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:02.63,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Adagaki-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.00,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:07.96,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! I almost started \Ntalking to her reflexively!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.09,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,As Master said, mixing \Nthings up is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:14.88,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:33.33,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I did it! I actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.54,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I ignored the Cruel Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:39.04,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I might have also destroyed \Nall the effort and likability
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,that I've built up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:46.46,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But the die is cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.67,Supplementary,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Supplementary Class
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.74,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:04.58,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sitting here, Masamune-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.90,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Is this seat available?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:08.25,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.61,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.35,Main,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Makabe-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:14.55,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.78,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.77,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Well, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:32.76,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You miss me like crazy now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.19,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I-It backfired?! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:52.53,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Are you telling me not to \Ntry to get close yet, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:15.78,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What if it's always going \Nto be like this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.54,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Was I actually some \Nbackground character?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.21,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:33.07,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She suddenly ambushed me head-on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.03,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:40.13,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to say that at this \Npoint, wouldn't it usually...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.57,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Um, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:45.06,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I have something to talk \Nto you about, Makabe-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.25,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,...be more like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:50.61,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of being all shy, she's totally \Nin angry Cruel Princess mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:53.43,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,M-Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.14,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.35,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Ow! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:02.20,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that! That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:30.78,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:31.92,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:36.28,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?! Are you absolutely stupid?! \NWhat are you even trying to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:38.18,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop! Stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:43.06,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I won't stop! What's going on?! \NStupid, stupid, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:43.11,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It's like I'm in a brawl or getting \Nthreatened by some thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Does this mean I'll never be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.16,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,be like the protagonist in a shojo manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.90,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:05.20,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.56,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.92,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,This is totally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.87,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,her being all shy, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:23.72,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait, wait. You can't \Nfall for a shy Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:27.10,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing, Master! It went \Njust like you said it would!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.19,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm going turn things back around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.14,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:37.11,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for you \Nto say that, Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:39.45,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wha— You mean it was on purpose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.12,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:47.38,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A-Awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.63,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I just received a comment that cut like a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:53.43,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure this didn't backfire, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:55.74,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:59.51,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She's calling me harsh things like "awful," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.33,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're truly awful. I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:06.06,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Even though she's yelling at me, \Nshe doesn't sound prickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.14,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,but actually sounds kind of troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:11.31,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I think this is where I'm \Nsupposed to go out on a limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.33,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.40,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, that's because I lik—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.79,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What is there to like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:22.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.38,Main,Girl1,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}My sign was ranked #1 in today's horoscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.94,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You want me to state the reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:28.41,Main,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Wow, lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.07,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You have a pretty face, but you hate guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:39.26,pudding,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding \NPrince
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:35.84,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You have a great body,\Nbut you're a gluttonous fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:39.01,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're smart, but you're oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:42.47,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,And you ask what there is to like \Nabout such a Cruel Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:50.31,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I hadn't really thought about it! Teehee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.89,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I probably shouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.15,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:59.28,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,E-Everything! Everything about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.24,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:03.58,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're absolutely the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.70,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oops, sorry! Just remembered \NI have somewhere I need to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:08.91,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.83,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, Masamune-kun?! Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.33,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You actually managed to get that \Nmuch of a reaction out of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:16.38,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:18.13,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.17,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:24.55,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:25.79,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.74,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't consider that you hadn't \Neven thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.68,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lose hope in me! That pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:33.39,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,We need to think of something! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:35.92,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, give me something that'll make \Nher heart flutter when she hears it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:39.36,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not some cat robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.80,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I know. What if I tell her she's pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:42.57,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:44.67,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? No? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.51,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't sigh right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.12,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A letter's the only way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:54.02,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If I try to say it verbally, \NI'll probably flub it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.19,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Master's ideas are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.29,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.76,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,P-Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:05.80,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, would you mind reading this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It says how I feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.58,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I absolutely despise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:36.56,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You seem to have the wrong idea. I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:37.58,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.83,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You can't fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:43.63,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I saw through your selfishness \Na long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.01,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Adagaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.33,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.48,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.57,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea what's going on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:04.59,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She suddenly says she despises \Nme and runs off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:08.52,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,And she's acting totally \Ndifferent from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.37,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.73,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I thought things were finally \Ngoing well yesterday. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:18.90,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:22.00,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have an idea what's \Ngoing on? Tell me, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:25.67,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I just said to leave it to me, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:31.99,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, you can't even explain \Nwhat you like about Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:35.76,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That means nothing you say \Nwill get through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.15,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:44.20,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. I'll make sure you'll \Nbe able to go out with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.83,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Is she telling the Pig's \NFoot to stay out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:56.49,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, Makabe Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:59.88,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Who is this revenge for? \NIt's for me, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:04.18,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get my revenge if I'm just sitting \Nhere like I'm waiting to be fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:08.85,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That's unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.81,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've skipped class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:27.14,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,A-Am I going to get in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.28,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:31.11,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.77,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it, Cookie! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:45.69,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't take it anymore! \NWhy must I feel so irritated?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.72,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,This is all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:52.02,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You're absolutely the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:55.22,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oops, sorry! Just remembered \NI have somewhere I need to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.43,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.35,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You forgot this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:06.32,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.78,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,"Master"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:12.90,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't consider that you hadn't \Neven thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.07,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lose hope in me! That pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.86,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,We need to think of something! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:20.33,Flashback,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, give me something that'll make \Nher heart flutter when she hears it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:23.03,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What does he mean by "everything"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.69,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm not some cat robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:25.75,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I bet he's been saying that to \Nall the girls! That scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.82,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,When did he and Yoshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:33.26,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,After he asked me out on \Na date so many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.72,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it'd end up like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:39.06,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:49.51,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:56.94,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:59.67,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I can decide for myself whether \NI want to go to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.41,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You can go back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:05.70,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Aki-sama, I was meeting \Nwith Makabe Masamune-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.65,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,He needed someone to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.87,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? And?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.84,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,He emailed and called me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:16.97,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:20.56,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter to me that \Nyou and Makabe are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.06,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.31,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's inconceivable. Why would I \Nbe sad over that cocky narcissist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:32.68,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.12,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, this girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.34,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,She's usually so slow, but somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.89,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,she's always so sharp when \Nit comes to things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.71,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.64,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I would never be sad over a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.97,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That'll never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:08.45,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Because there's something that \NI still believe in very strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.65,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are all just liars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.57,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,They're selfish and do whatever \Nthey want, and in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:18.11,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,They act like nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:21.13,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That might be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:24.94,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it is. That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:30.57,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's inconceivable that \NI would ever like a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:34.28,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be sad about the fact \Nthat Makabe Masamune was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.41,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,meeting with Yoshino without my knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.72,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,let alone fall in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:41.55,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,There's no doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.53,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.02,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,He only has eyes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:54.69,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,You like him too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:13.09,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Th-That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.25,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.38,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second, Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:26.14,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.99,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:38.16,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I so irritated? I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.92,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.94,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm such a terrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:48.54,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I've always hurt other people \Nso I wouldn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.11,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,If it means never having \Nto go through that again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.82,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather be hated and have people \Nkeep their distance from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.13,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I did everything I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:00.63,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I remembering the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.72,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:09.14,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if he actually likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:12.73,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:17.52,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:38.84,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I finally found you and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.97,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell were you \Nthinking?! The light was red!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.13,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's not like it matters to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:47.22,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:51.40,Main,Masasmune,0000,0000,0000,,Of course that's not true! I don't \Nknow what I'd do without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:57.19,Flashback,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:05.11,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A-Adagaki-san? Sorry, \NI might've said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:10.59,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:16.50,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:26.68,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so terribly sorry! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.64,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Were you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:34.35,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.29,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:42.26,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,My Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.62,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Our Father, who art in heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.24,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.71,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that this \Ncould happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:56.23,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I've been longing to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.01,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell is this?!
